          "type": "code",
          "language": "Python 3 · 补充示例",
          "text": "a = [1, 2]\nb = a\nb.append(3)\nprint(a)  # [1, 2, 3]\n\nc = a.copy()\nc.append(4)\nprint(a)  # [1, 2, 3]"
